      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "能瞭解組織中有關個人行為、群體行為、組織系統特性等方面之重要知識。",
      "describe_en": "To know the important knowledge in organizations from the aspects of individual behavior, group behavior and organization system."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": ".能運用適當之組織行為相關知識及本身人際能力，以促進組織中之溝通與協調合作。",
      "describe_en": "To effectively apply related OB knowledge and human skills to improve the communication and coordination in organizations."
